tor","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows March to April came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 the middle got 33% of normal in January to February and 198% in March to April. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 30% of normal on the middle. Grid 18719 had its driest year in 2011, at 48% of normal.</p>"}
